 "Commandes d’affectation, repos, annulation, journal, carte et recrutement conservées. Affichage adapté aux petits écrans, en solo et en multijoueur, y compris après reprise.": "Posting, rest, cancellation, journal, card and recruitment orders retained. View suitable for small screens, solo and multiplayer, including after recovery.",
