 "Module actif 2 tours, tour d’activation inclus. Localiser prend toujours 1 tour. Validité de la position après résolution : Hostile/Réticente 2 tours, Neutre/Favorable 3, Soutien total 4 ; avec relais : 4/4/5/5/6 tours. Drone : 4 → 6 tours ; intimidation : 1 → 3 tours. Toutes les positions encore valides gagnent immédiatement 2 tours ; les nouvelles localisations obtenues pendant le relais gagnent aussi 2 tours, quelle que soit leur source. Les prolongations restent après expiration naturelle, mais sont retirées à l’annulation. Une fuite invalide toujours la position. Annulation le tour d’activation : coût remboursé.": "Operates for 2 turns, including the activation turn. Locating a target always takes 1 turn. A location normally lasts 2 turns with Hostile or Reluctant cooperation, 3 with Neutral or Favorable, and 4 with Full support. With the relay, those durations are 4, 4, 5, 5, and 6 turns. Drone locations last 6 turns instead of 4, and intimidation locations last 3 turns instead of 1. Existing locations and all locations found while the relay operates gain 2 turns. Extensions persist after the module expires and are removed if it is canceled. A fleeing suspect invalidates their known location. Canceling on the activation turn refunds the cost.",
