 "Relève en Avancé": "Upgrading to Advanced",
 "Relève en Avancé : propositions parmi les anciens agents, hors des seize du repêchage. Réservation exclusive des recrues humaines et PNJ pendant les deux tours de recrutement. Bouton Renforts & relève retiré du menu Agents ; recrutement conservé pour les postes vacants et les annonces de décès.": "In Advanced mode, replacements come from veteran agents outside the sixteen-agent draft. Each offered recruit is reserved for one player or AI faction during the two-turn recruitment period. Recruiting for empty slots remains available through vacancy and casualty notices. The Reinforcements & Replacements button has been removed from the Agents menu.",
